sequenceDiagram
    participant G as KrakenD gateway
    participant F as CorrelationIdFilter (starter)
    participant A as Service code
    participant T as Error dispatch
    G->>F: GET /x, x-bfi-req-id: abc
    Note over F: MDC correlation_id=abc<br/>response header x-bfi-req-id: abc
    F->>A: doFilter
    A-->>F: throws
    Note over F: MDC kept, so Tomcat's "Servlet.service() threw exception" line carries abc
    F->>T: ERROR dispatch, same id from the request attribute
    T-->>G: 500, x-bfi-req-id: abc, error page lines carry correlation_id=abc
